{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K2YTAcZ36BQK1ZYqVmqJaj","type":"tool_result","content":"1054:- `game.audio.define(name, voice)`: add or replace a named sound: audio.define('zap', { wave: 'saw', freq: 1200, to: 200, dur: .2 })\n1063:- `game.audio.sfx(what, o = {})`: Play a sound effect: a preset name ('jump', 'coin', 'hit', 'explode', ...), a voice object, or a list of voices. opts: { vol: 0..1, pitch: multiplier, vary: random pitch spread (default 0.03), step: a step of the music playing (it sounds on that step of the music clock, scheduled with the music: a rhythm game's calls and claps) }\n1074:- `game.audio.offset = 0` †: seconds the music sounds early, for speakers and headphones that lag (settings.audioOffset)\n1075:- `game.audio.presets`: the named sound effects, sfx(name) plays one and define(name, voice) adds one\n1106:- `new E.Dialog(game, o = {}) → talk`: new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, place, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars }): a dialog box that types its text; say() opens it, update(dt) and draw(r) run it\n1123:- `talk.name`: the speaker's name shown on the box\n1124:- `talk.nameColor = '#ffd36a'`: the speaker's name's color\n1134:- `talk.voice = 'text'`: the sound effect each letter blips ('text'; null for silence)\n1267:- `click.say(lines, who)` †: the hero says lines (over his head; a line's time by its length); who: anything with x, y and k to speak instead\n1543:- `new E.Rhythm(game, o = {}) → rhythm` †: new E.Rhythm(game, { song, chart, lanes, windows, life, lead, voice, on }): see the manual\n1570:- `rhythm.voice` †: the calls' sound\n1668:- `story.people`: who speaks, by id ({ name, portrait, at })\n1672:- `story.talk`: the E.Dialog it speaks through","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c28e7abf-db6e-401a-a911-43ba9983a968","uuid":"4a0d5221-7475-4113-a881-634feaa0ca5e","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:54:52.081Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1054:- `game.audio.define(name, 