{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016dyYJ2D1sAKN1czBUNsigE","type":"tool_result","content":"271:- `E.Input.DEFAULT { attack, dash, skill, jump }`: top-down / isometric action (Zelda, Diablo): Space dashes, J or click attacks\n275:- `E.Input.halfKeys(preset, side)` †: a preset for half a keyboard ('left' or 'right'): its moves and menu keys, the preset's other actions on its buttons in order, and the preset's gamepad codes (Input.halfKeys(Input.SHMUP, 'right') -> fire on . and Numpad 1, bomb on /)\n320:- `input.use(map)`: switch key layout at runtime: input.use(E.Input.PLATFORMER) or input.use('SHMUP'). The player's own bindings (bindings, set by rebind() and the Controls screen) are laid over it. Every preset (E.Input.DEFAULT, PLATFORMER, THIRDPERSON, SHMUP) has the moves (up, down, left, right) and the menu's actions (start, pause, confirm, cancel)\n334:- `input.padAim = null` †: its right stick, or null when centered\n340:- `input.preset` †: the layout last given to use() (E.Input.DEFAULT, PLATFORMER, SHMUP or your own)\n1340:- `E.FIGHT_KEYS: up, down, left, right, lp, hp, lk, hk, start, pause, confirm, cancel` †: the fighting preset (a scene's input): the moves and menu keys of E.Input.DEFAULT, light and heavy punch (U, I; a pad's X, Y), light and heavy kick (J, K; A, B)\n133:/** the 4 x 4 ordered-dither threshold 0..1 at pixel (x, y): pixel on when value > bayer(x, y) */\n1159:      const dirs = [this.padMove[1] < -.5, this.padMove[1] > .5, this.padMove[0] < -.5, this.padMove[0] > .5];\n1234:    const [x, y] = this.stick, on = [y < -.5, y > .5, x < -.5, x > .5], was = this._sd || (this._sd = [false, false, false, false]);\n1757:    if (z > .5 && this._map && !(o && o.occluder)) {\n1836:    (z > .5 ? f => this.queue(x, y, z - .01, f, { noInfo: true, bias: -.001 }) : f => this.decal(f))(() => {\n1845:      const [sx, sy] = this.w(x, y, z); (z > .5 ? this.ctx : this.tgt).drawImage(st.c, Math.round(sx) + st.ox, Math.round(sy) + st.oy);\n1959:        const lit = .6 * nx + .8 * ny, col = lit < -.2 ? shade(side, .12) : lit > .5 ? shade(side, -.25) : side;\n2023:    this.queue(x, y, z, g => this._composite(g, x, y, z, drawFn, o), { bias: o.bias, xray: o.xray, info: gI => this._actorInfo(gI, x, y, z, o), solid: o.alpha === undefined || o.alpha > .5, actor","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c28e7abf-db6e-401a-a911-43ba9983a968","uuid":"aad3e933-da5e-4c1e-a867-5c5e362d6af2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:07:04.312Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"271:- `E.Input.DEFAULT { attack, dash, skill, jump }`: top-down / isometric action (Zelda, Diablo): Space dashes, J or click attacks\n275:- `E.Input.halfKeys(preset, side)` †: a preset for half a keyboard ('left' or 'right'): its moves and menu keys, the preset's other actions on its buttons in order, and the preset's gamepad codes (Input.halfKeys(Input.SHMUP, 'right') -> fire on . and Numpad 1, bomb on /)\n320:- `input.use(map)`: switch key layout at runtime: input.use(E.Input.PLATFORMER) or input.use('SHMUP'). The player's own bindings (bindings, set by rebind() and the Controls screen) are laid over it. Every preset (E.Input.DEFAULT, PLATFORMER, THIRDPERSON, SHMUP) has the moves (up, down, left, right) and the menu's actions (start, pause, confirm, cancel)\n334:- `input.padAim = null` †: its right stick, or null when centered\n340:- `input.preset` †: the layout last given to use() (E.Input.DEFAULT, PLATFORMER, SHMUP or your own)\n1340:- `E.FIGHT_KEYS: up, down, left, right, lp, hp, lk, hk, start, pause, confirm, cancel` †: the fighting preset (a scene's input): the moves and menu keys of E.Input.DEFAULT, light and heavy punch (U, I; a pad's X, Y), light and heavy kick (J, K; A, B)\n133:/** the 4 x 4 ordered-dither threshold 0..1 at pixel (x, y): pixel on when value > bayer(x, y) */\n1159:      const dirs = [this.padMove[1] < -.5, this.padMove[1] > .5, this.padMove[0] < -.5, this.padMove[0] > .5];\n1234:    const [x, y] = this.stick, on = [y < -.5, y > .5, x < -.5, x > .5], was = this._sd || (this._sd = [false, false, false, false]);\n1757:    if (z > .5 && this._map && !(o && o.occluder)) {\n1836:    (z > .5 ? f => this.queue(x, y, z - .01, f, { noInfo: true, bias: -.001 }) : f => this.decal(f))(() => {\n1845:      const [sx, sy] = this.w(x, y, z); (z > .5 ? this.ctx : this.tgt).drawImage(st.c, Math.round(sx) + st.ox, Math.round(sy) + st.oy);\n1959:        const lit = .6 * nx + .8 * ny, col = lit < -.2 ? shade(side, .12) : lit > .5 ? shade(side, -.25) : side;\n2023:    this.queue(x, y, z, g => this._composite(g, x, y, z, drawFn, o), { bias: o.bias, xray: o.xray, info: gI => this._actorInfo(gI, x, y, z, o), solid: o.alpha === undefined || o.alpha > .5, actor","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016dyYJ2D1sAKN1czBUNsigE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
